part worth
  tally 2
  note "D-08: what Halina has, as D-HR4 counts it. The house ul. Leśna 4 counts at its latest valuation (D-HR4 .4); it has never been valued, so it has no reading."

input house_value: money DUK reading question "What did an agent or a bank value the house ul. Leśna 4 at (D-HR4 .4)? It has never been valued."

def house_at[d in day]: money DUK = last(house_value, d) at d
